CanClearSupplyAtPriceTest
├── when highLhs GT highRhs
│   └── it returns true
├── when highLhs EQ highRhs and lowLhs GT lowRhs
│   └── it returns true
├── when highLhs EQ highRhs and lowLhs EQ lowRhs
│   └── it returns true
├── when highLhs LT highRhs
│   └── it returns false
├── when highLhs EQ highRhs and lowLhs LT lowRhs
│   └── it returns false
├── when demand * remainingMps GT remainingSupply (fuzz)
│   └── it returns true
├── when demand * remainingMps EQ remainingSupply (fuzz)
│   └── it returns true
└── when demand * remainingMps LT remainingSupply (fuzz)
    └── it returns false
